{"id": "EUVD-2026-96994", "enisaUuid": "220abf07-df32-3a23-8984-e8487a5f4ff1", "description": "phpIPAM through 1.8.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated low-privilege users to view restricted subnets and addresses because customer, location and NAT pages skip Subnets::check_permission. Attackers can open customer objects.php, single-location.php or nat_details.php to read IP addresses, CIDRs, hostnames and MAC addresses from sections they cannot access.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:17:08", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/phpipam-tools-cross-section-address-disclosure", "https://github.com/phpipam/phpipam/blob/e8010751d491e485acefa5787fb0e518eb948771/app/tools/customers/customer/objects/ipaddresses.php#L69-L110", "https://github.com/phpipam/phpipam/blob/e8010751d491e485acefa5787fb0e518eb948771/app/tools/locations/single-location.php#L129-L195", "https://github.com/phpipam/phpipam/blob/e8010751d491e485acefa5787fb0e518eb948771/app/tools/nat/nat_details.php#L16-L45", "https://github.com/phpipam/phpipam", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpipam-through-1.8.3-missing-authorization-in-customers-locations-and-nat-pages"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rv8q-2v6x-vpgr", "CVE-2026-108720"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6d2c2e5f-5826-3fc2-a6ba-a0f15e4aa151", "product": {"name": "phpipam", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.8.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "20d3cb87-1cc2-3f2f-ae32-fa5339901132", "vendor": {"name": "phpipam"}}], "isExploited": false}